  "content": "<!doctype lake><meta name=\"doc-version\" content=\"1\" /><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"fixed\" /><meta name=\"typography\" content=\"classic\" /><p data-lake-id=\"u67d4f506\" id=\"u67d4f506\"><span data-lake-id=\"uf663e08b\" id=\"uf663e08b\" class=\"lake-fontsize-11\" style=\"color: rgb(36, 41, 47)\">循环队列 (Circular Queue) 是一种数据结构（或称环形队列、圆形队列）。它类似于普通队列，但是在循环队列中，当队列尾部到达数组的末尾时，它会从数组的开头重新开始。这种数据结构通常用于需要固定大小的队列，例如计算机内存中的缓冲区。循环队列可以通过数组或链表实现，它具有高效的入队和出队操作。</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"ued27753f\" id=\"ued27753f\"><span data-lake-id=\"u3a461d1f\" id=\"u3a461d1f\" class=\"lake-fontsize-11\" style=\"color: rgb(36, 41, 47)\">​</span><br></p><h2 data-lake-id=\"x8VDb\" id=\"x8VDb\"><span data-lake-id=\"u7c49bc35\" id=\"u7c49bc35\" style=\"color: rgb(36, 41, 47)\">队列和循环队列</span></h2><p data-lake-id=\"u2333ceda\" id=\"u2333ceda\"><card type=\"inline\" name=\"image\" value=\"data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2023%2Fpng%2F27903758%2F1703862300154-d9cadcc5-783b-442f-8336-cbba4ba7fbd0.png%22%2C%22taskId%22%3A%22u2e4ad619-e864-4a47-b560-9f191045511%22%2C%22clientId%22%3A%22u26970222-294e-4%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22binary%22%2C%22width%22%3A839%2C%22height%22%3A378%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22_blank%22%2C%22name%22%3A%22image.png%22%2C%22size%22%3A27487%2C%22from%22%3A%22paste%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A839%2C%22originHeight%22%3A378%2C%22ratio%22%3A1%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22ocrLocations%22%3A%5B%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E9%98%9F%E5%88%97%3A%E4%B8%80%E7%A7%8D%E6%95%B0%E6%8D%AE%E7%BB%93%E6%9E%84%2C%E7%89%B9%E7%82%B9%E6%98%AF%E5%85%88%E8%BF%9B%E5%85%88%E5%87%BA%2C%E5%90%8E%E8%BF%9B%E5%90%8E%E5%87%BA.%22%2C%22x%22%3A151%2C%22y%22%3A43%2C%22width%22%3A473%2C%22height%22%3A23%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E5%8F%AF%E7%94%A8%E6%95%B0%E7%BB%84%E6%88%96%E9%93%BE%E8%A1%A8%E5%AE%9E%E7%8E%B0%22%2C%22x%22%3A301%2C%22y%22%3A70%2C%22width%22%3A193%2C%22height%22%3A22%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E9%98%9F%E9%A6%96%E6%8C%87%E9%92%88HEAD